warmup {"text": "This is a warm-up line. It is not counted in the results.", "sample_rate": 44100, "audio_s": 4.551, "gen_s": 4.488, "rtf": 0.9861, "ttfa_s": 3.7821, "frames_usage": 98, "frames_from_samples": 98.0, "ms_per_frame_whole_request": 45.8, "ms_per_frame_after_first_audio": 8.02, "chunks": 5, "first_chunk_s": 0.464, "finish_reason": "stop", "start_epoch": 1793381137.262, "first_audio_epoch": 1793381141.044, "end_epoch": 1793381141.749}
seq price {"text": "One RTX Pro six thousand costs about fifteen and a half thousand euros. Two Tenstorrent P one-fifty cards cost about a fifth of that.", "sample_rate": 44100, "audio_s": 12.074, "gen_s": 2.088, "rtf": 0.1729, "ttfa_s": 0.1645, "frames_usage": 260, "frames_from_samples": 260.0, "ms_per_frame_whole_request": 8.03, "ms_per_frame_after_first_audio": 7.69, "chunks": 8, "first_chunk_s": 0.464, "finish_reason": "stop", "start_epoch": 1793381141.751, "first_audio_epoch": 1793381141.915, "end_epoch": 1793381143.839}
seq model {"text": "The model is Kwen three point eight, twenty-seven billion parameters, at four-bit: N V F P four on the RTX, B F four on the Tenstorrent cards.", "sample_rate": 44100, "audio_s": 13.282, "gen_s": 2.324, "rtf": 0.175, "ttfa_s": 0.201, "frames_usage": 286, "frames_from_samples": 286.0, "ms_per_frame_whole_request": 8.13, "ms_per_frame_after_first_audio": 7.69, "chunks": 8, "first_chunk_s": 0.464, "finish_reason": "stop", "start_epoch": 1793381143.839, "first_audio_epoch": 1793381144.04, "end_epoch": 1793381146.163}
seq specs {"text": "Each card has a hundred and twenty Tensix cores and four Q S F P D D ports. Speculative decoding with D Flash two gives us eighty-seven tokens per second.", "sample_rate": 44100, "audio_s": 14.768, "gen_s": 2.549, "rtf": 0.1726, "ttfa_s": 0.1627, "frames_usage": 318, "frames_from_samples": 318.0, "ms_per_frame_whole_request": 8.02, "ms_per_frame_after_first_audio": 7.75, "chunks": 8, "first_chunk_s": 0.464, "finish_reason": "stop", "start_epoch": 1793381146.164, "first_audio_epoch": 1793381146.327, "end_epoch": 1793381148.713}
seq close {"text": "So, did we exit the moat? Not yet. But the climb is shorter than I thought.", "sample_rate": 44100, "audio_s": 6.78, "gen_s": 1.203, "rtf": 0.1775, "ttfa_s": 0.1558, "frames_usage": 146, "frames_from_samples": 146.0, "ms_per_frame_whole_request": 8.24, "ms_per_frame_after_first_audio": 7.7, "chunks": 6, "first_chunk_s": 0.464, "finish_reason": "stop", "start_epoch": 1793381148.714, "first_audio_epoch": 1793381148.87, "end_epoch": 1793381149.917}
seq cold_open {"text": "This is the sound of a fourteen-hundred-dollar AI card not working. I spent a whole day sure it was broken. Both of them. They weren't.", "sample_rate": 44100, "audio_s": 11.471, "gen_s": 1.998, "rtf": 0.1742, "ttfa_s": 0.1609, "frames_usage": 247, "frames_from_samples": 247.0, "ms_per_frame_whole_request": 8.09, "ms_per_frame_after_first_audio": 7.75, "chunks": 7, "first_chunk_s": 0.464, "finish_reason": "stop", "start_epoch": 1793381149.918, "first_audio_epoch": 1793381150.078, "end_epoch": 1793381151.915}
seq server {"text": "Power on, the power supply shuts off. Without a power cable on the card, it still shuts off. With an old Radeon in the same slot, everything works.", "sample_rate": 44100, "audio_s": 12.632, "gen_s": 2.167, "rtf": 0.1715, "ttfa_s": 0.1594, "frames_usage": 272, "frames_from_samples": 272.0, "ms_per_frame_whole_request": 7.97, "ms_per_frame_after_first_audio": 7.66, "chunks": 8, "first_chunk_s": 0.464, "finish_reason": "stop", "start_epoch": 1793381151.916, "first_audio_epoch": 1793381152.076, "end_epoch": 1793381154.083}
seq second_opinion {"text": "Second opinion: my desktop. It boots, the card's fans spin, and Windows never sees it. Card two: identical. Two dead cards. I wrote the return ticket.", "sample_rate": 44100, "audio_s": 13.886, "gen_s": 2.382, "rtf": 0.1715, "ttfa_s": 0.1576, "frames_usage": 299, "frames_from_samples": 299.0, "ms_per_frame_whole_request": 7.97, "ms_per_frame_after_first_audio": 7.7, "chunks": 8, "first_chunk_s": 0.464, "finish_reason": "stop", "start_epoch": 1793381154.084, "first_audio_epoch": 1793381154.241, "end_epoch": 1793381156.466}
seq fix {"text": "One last try with the power supply's own cable instead of the adapter. It boots. The card shows up, healthy. The adapter was the problem the whole time.", "sample_rate": 44100, "audio_s": 13.189, "gen_s": 2.259, "rtf": 0.1713, "ttfa_s": 0.1581, "frames_usage": 284, "frames_from_samples": 284.0, "ms_per_frame_whole_request": 7.95, "ms_per_frame_after_first_audio": 7.67, "chunks": 8, "first_chunk_s": 0.464, "finish_reason": "stop", "start_epoch": 1793381156.466, "first_audio_epoch": 1793381156.624, "end_epoch": 1793381158.725}
